List all operations performed on the account.
You can filter the list of tasks by domain name.

USAGE:
  scw domain task list [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  [project-id]         Filter tasks by project ID.
  [domain]             Filter tasks by domain name.
  [types.{index}]      Filter tasks by type. (unknown | create_domain | create_external_domain | renew_domain | transfer_domain | trade_domain | lock_domain_transfer | unlock_domain_transfer | enable_dnssec | disable_dnssec | update_domain | update_contact | delete_domain | cancel_task | generate_ssl_certificate | renew_ssl_certificate | send_message | delete_domain_expired | delete_external_domain | create_host | update_host | delete_host | move_project | transfer_online_domain)
  [statuses.{index}]   Filter tasks by status. (unavailable | new | waiting_payment | pending | success | error)
  [order-by]           Sort order of the returned tasks. (domain_desc | domain_asc | type_asc | type_desc | status_asc | status_desc | updated_at_asc | updated_at_desc)
  [organization-id]    Filter tasks by organization ID.

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for list
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers       Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use
